    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russia, May 1918. In the midst of a civil war, the Bolsheviks have recently seized power. Tsar Nicholas II has abdicated the throne, and has been placed under house arrest in Alexander Palace. You're a diplomat sent to negotiate with the new regime, but instead are suspected of being a spy. Thrown into prison, you face a grim fate. But one night, you have a nightmare. A gruesome scene - a dark, dingy basement, covered in blood, with walls covered in bullet holes. Seeing dead bodies of young women and men, you realise it's the Tsar's family. Waking up in a cold sweat, you make a decision. When the morning guard comes in to check on you, you'll kill him, take his gun and make your escape. The Tsar needs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575610/extras/61b28d1e6cf12c3a3b6d47ba15155c51.avif?t=1748925007\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolsheviktion 3D is written from the GROUND UP in pure C using a reimagined and enhanced implementation of John Carmack's original raycasting method. Full software rendering!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575610/extras/f428b0d9f8e98dbf273fae7803554f67.avif?t=1748925007\" width=252 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through nine distinct locations to discover the whereabouts of the Tsar, fighting through the Bolsheviks' most brutal battalions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique enemy types and two bosses to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty modes - Give Me a Go, Dad, Don't Be So Tough, Let's Go Boys! -- and for the insane gamer -- BOLSHEVIKTOR! (not even remotely fair)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure and even rarer royal treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret pushwalls containing exotic and useful items for combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom graphics, music and sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portuguese translation by Gustavo Carvalho De Souza Costa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian translation by Elena Beloborodova</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish translation by Erika Marcela Gomez Marin</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russia, May 1918. In the midst of a civil war, the Bolsheviks have recently seized power. Tsar Nicholas II has abdicated the throne, and has been placed under house arrest in Alexander Palace. You're a diplomat sent to negotiate with the new regime, but instead are suspected of being a spy. Thrown into prison, you face a grim fate. But one night, you have a nightmare. A gruesome scene - a dark, dingy basement, covered in blood, with walls covered in bullet holes. Seeing dead bodies of young women and men, you realise it's the Tsar's family. Waking up in a cold sweat, you make a decision. When the morning guard comes in to check on you, you'll kill him, take his gun and make your escape. The Tsar needs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575610/extras/61b28d1e6cf12c3a3b6d47ba15155c51.avif?t=1748925007\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolsheviktion 3D is written from the GROUND UP in pure C using a reimagined and enhanced implementation of John Carmack's original raycasting method. Full software rendering!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575610/extras/f428b0d9f8e98dbf273fae7803554f67.avif?t=1748925007\" width=252 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through nine distinct locations to discover the whereabouts of the Tsar, fighting through the Bolsheviks' most brutal battalions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique enemy types and two bosses to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty modes - Give Me a Go, Dad, Don't Be So Tough, Let's Go Boys! -- and for the insane gamer -- BOLSHEVIKTOR! (not even remotely fair)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure and even rarer royal treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret pushwalls containing exotic and useful items for combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom graphics, music and sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portuguese translation by Gustavo Carvalho De Souza Costa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian translation by Elena Beloborodova</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish translation by Erika Marcela Gomez Marin</p>",
    "short_description": "Russia, 1918. Bolsheviks are in power. Imprisoned on suspicion of being a spy, you plan to bust out and save the Tsar and his family from certain death. BOLSHEVIKTION 3D's an old-school FPS: an alt-history Wolf3D. Acquire new weapons, collect royal treasure and blast your way to Ipatiev House.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
